title "Groups"
layout layered dir=down
page 320x180mm margin=1cm
font 7pt..30pt wrap=12em

node syntax "group \"Title\" a, b, c color=#hex"
| draws a frame, title on top, around its members
node hard "A hard constraint, like require"
| the frame stays on the page and clear of every other node
| and every other group's frame; edges and links may cross it
| a group that cannot fit shows up in the E0110 core
node outer "Nesting is by membership"
| a group whose members all belong to a larger group
| is drawn inside it; list every inner node in the outer one too
node inner "Inner frame"
| group "Compiler" lex, parse, opt
| group "Front end" lex, parse
node exempt "Nested frames"
| are exempt from keeping clear of each other
node bad "E0010"
| two groups share some nodes but not all, or list the same nodes
node radial "Radial"
| a frame is a rectangle: fits a hub with its children,
| far better than nodes from different branches
node layered "Layered"
| room is kept for frames at both ends of the flow

syntax -> hard, outer, radial
hard -> layered
outer -> inner, bad
inner -> exempt

group "This frame is a group" outer, inner, exempt, bad color=#1565C0
group "Inside it, a nested group" inner, exempt color=#6A1B9A
